<title>USA: Celgene unit names Dryden to chairman.</title>
<headline>Celgene unit names Dryden to chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WARREN, N.J. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celgro, a new operating unit of Celgene Corp said it named R.N. Sam Dryden to the newly created position of chairman.</p>
<p>Dryden serves as president of Big Stone Inc, a private venture investment and development firm based in Boulder, Colorado.</p>
<p>Celgro develops and manufactures agricultural chemicals.</p>
<p>Celgene of Warren, N.J., uses proprietary expertise in small molecule chemistry to serve the pharmaceutical, agricultural and allied industries.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
